			<title type="html"><![CDATA[Pixel 11 specs and price leak with no surprises]]></title>
			<link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://www.theverge.com/tech/974238/pixel-11-specs-and-price-leak" />
			<id>https://www.theverge.com/?p=974238</id>
			<updated>2026-08-01T17:31:24-04:00</updated>
			<published>2026-08-01T17:31:24-04:00</published>
			<category scheme="https://www.theverge.com" term="Google" /><category scheme="https://www.theverge.com" term="Google Pixel" /><category scheme="https://www.theverge.com" term="News" /><category scheme="https://www.theverge.com" term="Tech" />
							<summary type="html"><![CDATA[Android Headlines claims to have the specs and price for the entire Pixel 11 lineup. What the site shared basically lines up with everything else that we've heard in the lead-up to the August 12th event. The Pixel 11 is expected to get a $100 price hike, starting at $899, but will come with 256GB [&#8230;]]]></summary>
			
							<content type="html">
											<![CDATA[

						
<figure>

<img alt="A teaser image of Google’s Pixel 11 Pro." data-caption="" data-portal-copyright="Image: Google" data-has-syndication-rights="1" src="https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/07/videoframe_16661.png?quality=90&#038;strip=all&#038;crop=0,0,100,100" />
	<figcaption>
		</figcaption>
</figure>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><em><a href="https://www.androidheadlines.com/google-pixel-11-specifications">Android Headlines</a></em> claims to have the specs and price for the entire Pixel 11 lineup. What the site shared basically lines up with everything else that we've heard in the lead-up to the <a href="https://www.theverge.com/tech/962313/made-by-google-pixel-11-launch-event">August 12th event</a>. The Pixel 11 is expected to get a $100 <a href="https://www.theverge.com/tech/971041/google-confirms-pixel-11-price-hike">price hike</a>, starting at $899, but will come with 256GB of storage instead of 128GB in the base model. While the entire lineup will sport the new Tensor G6 and Titan M3 chips, the base model Pixel 11 Pro and Pixel 11 Pro XL are both getting that rumored RAM cut to just 12GB, along with price increases to $1,099 and $1,299, respectively.</p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The Pixel 11 will supposedly ditch the telephoto lens and settle fo …</p>
<p><a href="https://www.theverge.com/tech/974238/pixel-11-specs-and-price-leak">Read the full story at The Verge.</a></p>
						]]>
									</content>
			
					</entry>
